ify before arrival.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"csus-library-group-study-rooms","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"University Library Group Study Rooms","title":"Put the Shared Screen to Work","subtitle":"Twelve rooms for groups of two or more","notes":"Reserve with SacLink up to a week ahead, bring at least one partner, and arrive within 15 minutes to protect the booking.","short_summary":"Bookable collaboration rooms equipped for discussion and shared visual work.","evidence_claim":"The University Library documents 12 group study rooms seating four to eight people, with Wi-Fi, power, flat screens, and whiteboards in all but rooms 135 and 3524.","source_url":"https://library.csus.edu/reserve-a-study-room","source_title":"Reserve a Study Room","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"SacLink login is required to reserve. Rooms are for groups of two or more, may be booked for up to two hours per day and one reservation per week, and are available when the library is open.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"csus-library-family-study-room-2003","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Family Study Room — Library 2003","title":"Study With Children Close By","subtitle":"A family-equipped room for student parents and guardians","notes":"Check out the key with your child present, supervise throughout the visit, and restore the room’s setup before returning it.","short_summary":"A shared study room designed around the practical needs of student caregivers.","evidence_claim":"Library 2003 contains adult and child-sized tables and chairs, children’s books, a hand-washing station, power outlets, a play mat, and a play tent.","source_url":"https://library.csus.edu/study-rooms-and-carrels/family-study-room","source_title":"Family Study Room","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Limited to eligible Sacramento State student parents or guardians with a child present at key checkout. First come, first served; up to four hours, once daily; two families maximum.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"csus-library-presentation-practice-room","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Library Presentation Practice Room","title":"Rehearse With the Camera Running","subtitle":"A reservable recording and presentation studio","notes":"Reserve ahead, bring a laptop for the wall display, and use a USB drive to take your rehearsal recording with you.","short_summary":"A purpose-built place to refine a class talk, conference presentation, or interview.","evidence_claim":"The room provides a large wall display, wall-mounted camera, confidence monitor, studio lights, green screen, and dedicated USB storage for presentation recordings.","source_url":"https://library.csus.edu/spotlight-and-events/library-presentation-practice-room","source_title":"Library Presentation Practice Room","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Reservations are required. The room is available to Sacramento State students, faculty, and staff during applicable library access hours.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"csus-library-zoom-rooms","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"University Library Zoom Rooms","title":"Take a Virtual Class Behind a Door","subtitle":"Individual rooms intended for Zoom sessions","notes":"Bring a current OneCard, request a key at the Service Desk, and return it early if the session ends before the three-hour loan expires.","short_summary":"A controlled setting for attending an online class while on campus.","evidence_claim":"The Library describes 